ProsperoSunshine: native DualSense haptics, in the protocol of Apollo Extended

A client that asks with 0x5506 gets an answer and then four-channel PCM blocks in 0x5504, which the platform layer fills from
the console's haptic channel. Artemis Extended plays them on a DualSense. Clients that do not ask get nothing new.

